# Job Portal Navigation System (JPNS)

## Overview

The Job Portal Navigation System (JPNS) is a console-based recruitment management application developed using C# and .NET. It provides a centralized platform for job seekers and administrators to manage recruitment activities, job postings, applications, interviews, notifications, and reports.

The system eliminates the need for multiple third-party recruitment platforms by offering an integrated hiring solution.

---

## Features

### Authentication & Security
- User Registration
- Secure Login & Logout
- OTP Verification
- Email Verification
- Password Reset
- Account Lock After Multiple Failed Attempts

### Job Seeker Features
- Create and Manage Profile
- Upload and Manage Resume
- Search Jobs
- Filter Jobs by Location, Salary, Skills, and Experience
- Save Jobs
- Apply for Jobs
- Track Application Status
- View Notifications
- View Interview Details

### Admin Features
- Create Job Listings
- Update Job Listings
- Delete Job Listings
- Close Job Postings
- View Applications
- Shortlist Candidates
- Reject Candidates
- Schedule Interviews
- Send Announcements
- Generate Reports

### Notification System
- Application Status Notifications
- Interview Invitations
- OTP Notifications
- Admin Announcements

### Reporting
- Hiring Funnel Reports
- Job Analytics Reports
- Application Statistics Reports
- CSV Export

